                <mxCell id="10" value="✅&lt;b&gt; Work Notes when Moving ticket to Pending&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Steps Perform so far&lt;/b&gt; - (before putting ticket in pending stage)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Status -&lt;/b&gt; (Current status such as other team dependency or user validation or more information needed from requester and so on)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Next Step&lt;/b&gt; - (Next course of action from user end))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0f0f0;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
